                                "sense_id": "60e7cfb1-9c3b-3aae-8068-ec0ae8813eeb",
                                "text": "As Wikipedia has grown in size and complexity, so has the task of quality control; today that responsibility falls to a cadre of cleverly programmed robots and “cyborgs” — software-assisted volunteers who spend hours patrolling recent edits. Beneath its calm exterior, Wikipedia is a battlezone, and these are its front lines."
